---
interface Props {
  language?: "de" | "en";
}

const { language = "de" } = Astro.props;
const isEnglish = language === "en";
---

<section class="mechanics-section" aria-labelledby="mechanics-title">
  <div class="mechanics-heading">
    <div class="mechanics-kicker">{isEnglish ? "Selected models" : "Ausgewählte Modelle"}</div>
    <div>
      <h2 id="mechanics-title">{isEnglish ? "A look into the mechanics" : "Ein Blick in die Mechanik"}</h2>
      <p>{isEnglish ? "Some mechanisms are particularly decisive in determining whether Commercial Management merely optimises the short term or creates structural impact." : "Einige Mechanismen entscheiden besonders stark darüber, ob Commercial Management nur kurzfristig optimiert oder strukturell Wirkung erzeugt."}</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="model-list">
    <article class="deep-dive">
      <div class="model-copy">
        <span class="model-index">A</span>
        <h3>Future Growth Logic</h3>
        <p>{isEnglish ? "Growth does not come from steering the existing business better alone. What matters is recognising structural constraints, changing their mechanics and creating new economic headroom." : "Wachstum entsteht nicht allein durch bessere Steuerung des Bestehenden. Entscheidend ist, strukturelle Begrenzungen zu erkennen, ihre Mechanik zu verändern und dadurch neue wirtschaftliche Spielräume zu schaffen."}</p>
      </div>
      <div class="growth-model" aria-label={isEnglish ? "Future Growth Logic from constraint through structural change and new economics to growth space" : "Future Growth Logic von Constraint über Structural Change und New Economics zu Growth Space"}>
        <div class="model-step">
          <span>01</span><strong>Constraint</strong><small>{isEnglish ? "Today's logic reaches a structural limit." : "Die heutige Logik stößt an eine strukturelle Grenze."}</small>
        </div>
        <div class="model-arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</div>
        <div class="model-step active-step">
          <span>02</span><strong>Structural Change</strong><small>{isEnglish ? "Value proposition, market, channel or technology changes the mechanics." : "Value Proposition, Markt, Kanal oder Technologie verändern die Mechanik."}</small>
        </div>
        <div class="model-arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</div>
        <div class="model-step">
          <span>03</span><strong>New Economics</strong><small>{isEnglish ? "Marginal cost, Customer Value or scalability follows a new logic." : "Grenzkosten, Kundenwert oder Skalierbarkeit folgen einer neuen Logik."}</small>
        </div>
        <div class="model-arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</div>
        <div class="model-step result-step">
          <span>04</span><strong>Growth Space</strong><small>{isEnglish ? "Additional economic headroom becomes scalable." : "Ein zusätzlicher wirtschaftlicher Spielraum wird skalierbar."}</small>
        </div>
      </div>
    </article>

    <article class="deep-dive reverse">
      <div class="model-copy">
        <span class="model-index">B</span>
        <h3>Customer Base Economics</h3>
        <p>{isEnglish ? "The customer base is an economic asset. Growth comes from its size, quality and dynamics, not from traffic or short-term revenue alone." : "Die Kundenbasis ist ein wirtschaftlicher Bestand. Wachstum entsteht aus Größe, Qualität und Dynamik dieses Bestands, nicht nur aus Traffic oder kurzfristigem Umsatz."}</p>
      </div>
      <div class="customer-model" aria-label={isEnglish ? "Customer Base Economics with target base, acquisition, reactivation, retention and churn" : "Customer Base Economics mit Zielbestand, Acquisition, Reactivation, Retention und Churn"}>
        <div class="target-base"><span>Target Base</span><strong>{isEnglish ? "Future economic target base" : "Zukünftiger wirtschaftlicher Zielbestand"}</strong></div>
        <div class="base-flow">
          <div class="inflows">
            <div><span>Acquisition</span><b aria-hidden="true">→</b></div>
            <div><span>Reactivation</span><b aria-hidden="true">→</b></div>
          </div>
          <div class="active-base">
            <span>Active Customer Base</span>
            <strong>{isEnglish ? "Size · Quality · Value" : "Größe · Qualität · Wert"}</strong>
            <small>{isEnglish ? "Retention stabilises the base" : "Retention stabilisiert den Bestand"}</small>
          </div>
          <div class="outflow"><b aria-hidden="true">→</b><span>Churn</span></div>
        </div>
        <div class="base-equation"><span>{isEnglish ? "Base today" : "Bestand heute"}</span><b>+</b><span>{isEnglish ? "Inflows" : "Zuflüsse"}</span><b>−</b><span>Churn</span><b>→</b><span>{isEnglish ? "Target base" : "Zielbestand"}</span></div>
      </div>
    </article>

    <article class="deep-dive">
      <div class="model-copy">
        <span class="model-index">C</span>
        <h3>Mechanism Transfer</h3>
        <p>{isEnglish ? "International scaling does not work through copy and paste. What matters is understanding the actual mechanism of impact and rebuilding it for the local context in the target market." : "Internationale Skalierung gelingt nicht durch Copy-Paste. Entscheidend ist, den eigentlichen Wirkungsmechanismus zu verstehen und ihn im Zielmarkt passend zum lokalen Kontext neu aufzusetzen."}</p>
      </div>
      <div class="transfer-model" aria-label={isEnglish ? "Mechanism Transfer from observation through deconstruction and isolation to rebuilding in the target market" : "Mechanism Transfer von Beobachten über Dekonstruieren und Isolieren bis zum Neuaufsetzen im Zielmarkt"}>
        <div class="transfer-step"><span>01</span><strong>{isEnglish ? "Observe" : "Beobachten"}</strong><small>{isEnglish ? "What actually works in the source market?" : "Was wirkt im Ausgangsmarkt tatsächlich?"}</small></div>
        <div class="model-arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</div>
        <div class="transfer-step"><span>02</span><strong>{isEnglish ? "Deconstruct" : "Dekonstruieren"}</strong><small>{isEnglish ? "Which contextual factors contribute to the impact?" : "Welche Kontextfaktoren tragen zur Wirkung bei?"}</small></div>
        <div class="model-arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</div>
        <div class="transfer-step mechanism-step"><span>03</span><strong>{isEnglish ? <>Isolate the impact <wbr />mechanism</> : <>Wirkungs<wbr />mechanismus isolieren</>}</strong><small>{isEnglish ? "What is transferable, and what is merely its visible expression?" : "Was ist übertragbar, was nur sichtbare Ausprägung?"}</small></div>
        <div class="model-arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</div>
        <div class="transfer-step result-step"><span>04</span><strong>{isEnglish ? "Rebuild in the target market" : "Im Zielmarkt neu aufsetzen"}</strong><small>{isEnglish ? "Adapt the mechanics to local context and constraints." : "Mechanik an lokalen Kontext und Constraints anpassen."}</small></div>
      </div>
    </article>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .mechanics-section { padding: 5.5rem 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border); }
  .mechanics-heading { display: grid; grid-template-columns: .34fr 1fr; gap: 4rem; align-items: start; margin-bottom: 3rem; }
  .mechanics-kicker { color: var(--color-amber); font-size: 11px; font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: .14em; text-transform: uppercase; }
  .mechanics-heading h2 { margin: 0 0 .7rem; color: var(--color-ink); font-size: 32px; font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: -.03em; line-height: 1.15; }
  .mechanics-heading p { max-width: 760px; margin: 0; color: var(--color-body); font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; }
  .model-list { border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border); }
  .deep-dive { display: grid; grid-template-columns: .72fr 1.55fr; gap: 3.5rem; align-items: center; padding: 4rem 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border); }
  .deep-dive.reverse { grid-template-columns: 1.55fr .72fr; }
  .deep-dive.reverse .model-copy { grid-column: 2; }
  .deep-dive.reverse .customer-model { grid-column: 1; grid-row: 1; }
  .model-index { display: block; margin-bottom: 1rem; color: var(--color-amber); font-size: 11px; font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: .12em; }
  .model-copy h3 { margin: 0 0 .85rem; color: var(--color-ink); font-size: 25px; font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: -.025em; line-height: 1.2; }
  .model-copy p { margin: 0; color: var(--color-body); font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.75; }
  .growth-model, .transfer-model { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 32px 1fr 32px 1fr 32px 1fr; align-items: stretch; padding: 1.15rem; background: rgba(255,255,255,.43); border: 1px solid var(--color-border-soft); }
  .model-step, .transfer-step { min-width: 0; min-height: 190px; padding: 1.25rem 1.05rem; background: rgba(248,251,253,.86); border: 1px solid rgba(30,60,100,.16); }
  .model-step span, .transfer-step span { display: block; margin-bottom: .7rem; color: var(--color-amber); font-size: 10px; font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: .1em; }
  .model-step strong, .transfer-step strong { display: block; color: var(--color-ink); font-size: 14px; font-weight: 500; line-height: 1.35; }
  .model-step small, .transfer-step small { display: block; margin-top: .75rem; color: var(--color-body); font-size: 11px; line-height: 1.55; }
  .active-step, .mechanism-step { background: linear-gradient(145deg, rgba(255,255,255,.92), rgba(232,239,246,.84)); border-top: 2px solid rgba(180,83,9,.68); }
  .result-step { background: rgba(230,238,246,.9); border-color: rgba(30,60,100,.25); }
  .model-arrow { display: grid; place-items: center; color: var(--color-amber); font-size: 22px; }

  .customer-model { padding: 1.25rem; background: rgba(255,255,255,.43); border: 1px solid var(--color-border-soft); }
  .target-base { display: grid; grid-template-columns: .45fr 1fr; gap: 1rem; align-items: center; margin: 0 auto 1rem; padding: .85rem 1rem; color: var(--color-ink); background: rgba(230,238,246,.88); border: 1px solid rgba(30,60,100,.2); border-top: 2px solid rgba(180,83,9,.65); }
  .target-base span { color: var(--color-amber); font-size: 10px; font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: .1em; text-transform: uppercase; }
  .target-base strong { font-size: 13px; font-weight: 500; line-height: 1.35; }
  .base-flow { display: grid; grid-template-columns: .75fr 1.35fr .65fr; gap: .85rem; align-items: center; }
  .inflows { display: grid; gap: .75rem; }
  .inflows > div, .outflow { display: flex; justify-content: flex-end; align-items: center; gap: .65rem; color: var(--color-ink-2); font-size: 11px; font-weight: 500; }
  .inflows b, .outflow b { color: var(--color-amber); font-size: 20px; font-weight: 400; }
  .active-base { position: relative; display: grid; min-height: 180px; place-content: center; padding: 1.4rem; text-align: center; background: linear-gradient(145deg, rgba(255,255,255,.94), rgba(220,232,242,.82)); border: 1px solid rgba(30,60,100,.24); box-shadow: inset 0 -5px 0 rgba(180,83,9,.58); }
  .active-base span { color: var(--color-amber); font-size: 11px; font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: .08em; text-transform: uppercase; }
  .active-base strong { margin-top: .7rem; color: var(--color-ink); font-size: 18px; font-weight: 500; }
  .active-base small { margin-top: .55rem; color: var(--color-body); font-size: 11px; }
  .outflow { justify-content: flex-start; }
  .base-equation { display: flex; justify-content: center; align-items: center; gap: .65rem; margin-top: 1rem; padding-top: 1rem; color: var(--color-ink-3); font-size: 10px; font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: .04em; border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border-soft); }
  .base-equation b { color: var(--color-amber); font-size: 15px; font-weight: 400; }

  @media (max-width: 980px) {
    .deep-dive, .deep-dive.reverse { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 2rem; }
    .deep-dive.reverse .model-copy, .deep-dive.reverse .customer-model { grid-column: auto; grid-row: auto; }
    .deep-dive.reverse .model-copy { order: 0; }
    .deep-dive.reverse .customer-model { order: 1; }
  }

  @media (max-width: 760px) {
    .mechanics-section { padding: 4rem 0; }
    .mechanics-heading { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 1rem; margin-bottom: 2rem; }
    .mechanics-heading h2 { font-size: 27px; }
    .deep-dive { padding: 3rem 0; }
    .growth-model, .transfer-model { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .model-step, .transfer-step { min-height: 0; }
    .model-arrow { min-height: 42px; transform: rotate(90deg); }
    .base-flow { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .inflows { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0,1fr)); }
    .inflows > div, .outflow { justify-content: center; }
    .inflows b { transform: rotate(90deg); }
    .outflow { flex-direction: column; }
    .outflow b { transform: rotate(90deg); }
    .base-equation { flex-wrap: wrap; }
  }

  @media (max-width: 420px) {
    .target-base { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: .35rem; }
    .inflows { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  }
</style>
